From b42c14be6b2939cee7efa24caebf053bde91f1af Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Maksym Vasylchuk <max@buzztv.com>
Date: Tue, 29 Sep 2026 19:19:51 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] androidmedia: Add aaudiosink and audiotracksink

openslessink tops out at stereo S16. aaudiosink plays PCM up to 7.1
through AAudio (channel masks need API 32) and IEC 61937 from API 34.
audiotracksink plays the same PCM through AudioTrack, plus AC-3, E-AC-3
and DTS as IEC 61937 from API 24, offering only what
isDirectPlaybackSupported() reports from API 29 on.

audiotracksink makes every JNI call on one thread it owns.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
