+/**
+ * SECTION:element-audiotracksink
+ * @title: audiotracksink
+ *
+ * Audio sink on android.media.AudioTrack.
+ *
+ * Plays PCM in the layouts Android opens, mono to 7.1 (see the pad
+ * template). With #GstAudioTrackSink:passthrough set it also takes parsed
+ * AC-3, E-AC-3 and DTS and sends them as IEC 61937
+ * (AudioFormat.ENCODING_IEC61937) for an external decoder. From API 29 only
+ * the codecs AudioTrack.isDirectPlaybackSupported() reports for the current
+ * output are offered; before that all three are, and a track the output
+ * cannot take fails to open.
+ *
+ * Every JNI call is made on one thread the element owns, never on the
+ * threads that change its state, so no thread the application created is
+ * ever attached to the VM by this element.
+ *
+ * ## Example pipeline
+ * |[
+ * gst-launch-1.0 audiotestsrc ! audioconvert ! audio/x-raw,channels=6 ! audiotracksink
+ * ]|
+ */
+
